#: search2:search2_92927362_E2C1_4E68_9DEE_63E8053449DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 158c89cee6e40dae82ee56b9cdc3fa33f12f19a742f3d8c41d90e6e71a5e5363
#. default-sha256: 743c0705a2f6faa219c893926c67a2b785d64d105dda2d5a7edfc3eba15ae551
msgctxt "search2:search2_92927362_E2C1_4E68_9DEE_63E8053449DB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“I carry within me the child of God!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“Eu carrego dentro de mim o filho de Deus!”"

#: search2:search2_A84944D9_4058_413F_9EE5_317AF8A5127D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddce8b7d88795aff4baec1bea4af37c68b7c459cdf7bd8d3f28a9c8b205724d2
#. default-sha256: debecbf7c5a92a0935a858039f0d61fa3ffdbcb2f485780ba5f44a7e1a098fb7
msgctxt "search2:search2_A84944D9_4058_413F_9EE5_317AF8A5127D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That is where it all began."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Foi aí que tudo começou."

#: search2:search2_F45BFCD5_8F99_4CBB_828C_9B089850B9D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0129d19e73bdb0a8d737765d7dce4e634ac3a684784a7a0d114d39f750eb5c1
#. default-sha256: 39d3598e183a6b3fa612101e0ee1749b5bb23f99b3da40ca4616ec7aaa70a7af
msgctxt "search2:search2_F45BFCD5_8F99_4CBB_828C_9B089850B9D0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I have been visited by an angel of the Lord!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Fui visitada por um anjo do Senhor!”"

#: search2:search2_C26E89B7_CD1C_450D_9AF6_8974349761C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf5c179dd9200d79d0cd58ef15cec5358e51768bcd3ab0876b5f181f060adcc1
#. default-sha256: 715e5e66dfbd7b10dac342125bd16b8e05d5cf1c2c916b18e355557fd1e9cf6c
msgctxt "search2:search2_C26E89B7_CD1C_450D_9AF6_8974349761C3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Ahh, she is the child of God!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Ahh, ela é a filha de Deus!”"

#: search2:search2_AEBF2782_1A37_447F_BB82_D469D662019C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6bf78e70bd0df349bfc9d13df9aa3f6384a37ab79bfb4cd5d5753640a6ed0104
#. default-sha256: fd88b4361d51e4d08db4341fbc40a8782e58f5ceac61a9c7963e05913786e813
msgctxt "search2:search2_AEBF2782_1A37_447F_BB82_D469D662019C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I am with child, though I have known no man”? ⟪k:1⟫Ahaha... as if that’s even possible.⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Maybe she had fooled around with a man who had gone and abandoned her, ⟪k:5⟫and she "
"spouted those lies to convince herself it had never happened.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫None of the "
"village men made any claim to be my father. ⟪k:10⟫Perhaps he was someone else’s husband, and as "
"such, he ⟪k:11⟫couldn’t⟪k:12⟫ reveal himself, as adultery is a sin in the eyes of God.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫The girl they were praising as the “child of God” was, indeed, naught more than the "
"ordinary daughter of a wretched woman."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Estou grávida, embora não tenha passado tempo com nenhum homem”? ⟪k:1⟫Ahaha... como se isso "
"sequer fosse possível.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Talvez ela tenha estado com um homem que a abandonou, ⟪k:5⟫e "
"ela contou essas mentiras para se convencer de que isso nunca aconteceu.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"Nenhum dos homens da aldeia afirmou ser meu pai. ⟪k:10⟫Talvez ele fosse o marido de outra pessoa "
"e, como tal, ⟪k:11⟫não poderia⟪k:12⟫ se revelar, pois adultério é pecado aos olhos de Deus.⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫A garota que eles louvavam como a “filha de Deus” era, de fato, nada mais do "
"que a filha comum de uma mulher miserável."

#: search2:search2_AF36E4C0_7E91_4143_A35A_B06C398BCF5C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 369e8e017de384ca250a846f3efde8b676bd4334ec707c0689251f4e9264dcac
#. default-sha256: 29f1b9cf63c8adf5d001b5c393a0049f703807b939164427c13995e7fd86b54e
msgctxt "search2:search2_AF36E4C0_7E91_4143_A35A_B06C398BCF5C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫At the time, though, I thought differently.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I believed my mother’s words, "
"convinced I was a saint. ⟪k:5⟫And it gave me a sense of duty—of purpose—rather than superiority. "
"⟪k:6⟫As the daughter of God, I believed it was my responsibility to help anyone in need.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫So every day, I prayed. ⟪k:10⟫I asked my Father what I could do—what I was ⟪k:11⟫meant⟪k:12⟫ "
"to do.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Not everyone is equally good, however. There will always be someone "
"who lends their ear to the Devil’s whispers. ⟪k:17⟫One man claimed I was the daughter of a "
"charlatan. ⟪k:18⟫He shouted for all to hear, “If you really are the child of God, then perform a "
"miracle for us.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Na época, porém, pensei diferente.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu acreditei nas palavras de minha "
"mãe, convencida de que eu era uma santa. ⟪k:5⟫E isso me deu um senso de dever—de propósito—ao "
"invés de superioridade. ⟪k:6⟫Como a filha de Deus, acreditava que era minha responsabilidade "
"ajudar os necessitados.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Então, todos os dias, eu rezava. ⟪k:10⟫Perguntei a meu Pai "
"o que eu poderia fazer—o que eu ⟪k:11⟫deveria⟪k:12⟫ fazer.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Nem todo mundo "
"é igualmente bom, no entanto. Sempre haverá alguém que dá ouvidos aos sussurros do Diabo. ⟪k:17⟫"
"Um homem alegou que eu era filha de uma charlatã. ⟪k:18⟫Ele gritou para que todos ouvissem, “Se "
"você realmente é a filha de Deus, realize um milagre para nós.”"

#: search2:search2_C7551378_9D24_43BA_93F2_DF242D91D40C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a08ed7bdc7570518bb65eba275e74678f960c2f0268105bd38e01eac3855423
#. default-sha256: 0cc51532f77511c5718ab1bf4a2ca6e7ba5593cd10b916479a75252b8127d4d8
msgctxt "search2:search2_C7551378_9D24_43BA_93F2_DF242D91D40C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Could he have been any more unreasonable?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Miracles are neither magic nor "
"parlor tricks; ⟪k:4⟫they are realized through the power of faith. ⟪k:5⟫A lowly villager has no "
"place demanding God prove His own divinity. ⟪k:6⟫It is the height of arrogance.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫But "
"the man refused to heed my words, ⟪k:10⟫so, having no other choice,⟪k:11⟫I contemplated what I "
"could do to show him I was, indeed, a saint.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫And blood was the spark of my "
"inspiration."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele poderia ter sido mais irracional?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Milagres não são mágica nem truques "
"baratos; ⟪k:4⟫eles são realizados através do poder da fé. ⟪k:5⟫Um humilde aldeão não tem o "
"direito de exigir que Deus prove Sua própria divindade. ⟪k:6⟫É o cúmulo da arrogância.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫Mas o homem se recusou a ouvir minhas palavras, ⟪k:10⟫então, não tendo outra escolha,⟪k:11⟫"
"pensei no que poderia fazer para mostrar a ele que eu era, de fato, uma santa.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫E o sangue foi a centelha da minha inspiração."

#: search2:search2_F4EFC2B5_1D15_473B_860F_F1713F2F9BE0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16477d526fe304db70c8f9afc09996b1ceb677c2338213835878034ce91e6ad2
#. default-sha256: 52a4c6223bf98c021692ca9dcd7a22a486e791f17c6c19c369c80a20529e9f69
msgctxt "search2:search2_F4EFC2B5_1D15_473B_860F_F1713F2F9BE0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫For my demonstration, I chose an elderly woman afflicted with a terrible disease. ⟪k:2⟫"
"She was on her deathbed, and no one thought she would live for longer than another day or two."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The woman was overjoyed when I came to visit her. ⟪k:7⟫Sincerely believing me "
"to be a holy servant of the Lord, she gathered all the strength she could muster to climb from "
"her bed and kiss my feet.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I felt an intensely deep love for this woman.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫Placing my hands upon her cheeks, I said with all the kindness in my heart,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Para minha demonstração, escolhi uma senhora idosa que sofria de uma doença terrível. "
"⟪k:2⟫Ela estava em seu leito de morte e ninguém pensava que ela viveria mais do que um ou dois "
"dias.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫A mulher ficou radiante quando fui visitá-la. ⟪k:7⟫Acreditando "
"sinceramente que eu era um santa serva do Senhor, ela reuniu todas as forças que pôde para sair "
"de sua cama e beijar meus pés.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Eu senti um amor intensamente profundo por esta mulher."
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Colocando minhas mãos em seu rosto, eu disse com toda a bondade em meu "
"coração,"

#: search2:search2_02E51490_984D_46B5_828E_15AC21AB4FEE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 515d081fe3dfaec058b13d3d655a30f62eb549c748846dad81dc5f3965d794b4
#. default-sha256: 58e02e29c3a067677b584d7569bf8ecaa1fd206d18e4dc1996b48c23c635de14
msgctxt "search2:search2_02E51490_984D_46B5_828E_15AC21AB4FEE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“My beloved sister, ⟪k:4⟫partake of my blood.”⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Minha amada irmã, ⟪k:4⟫partilhe do meu sangue.”⟪k:5⟫"

#: search2:search2_C7614FF8_B1F4_4682_B652_1C2D5D133B13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27e374911e7b0a25b745c3291a56604ed412dc292913463cd5f6df00a1b6fd37
#. default-sha256: 853301501bf3012781239a3d5a392b516b235382c9dec2a74403ebb07d98d862
msgctxt "search2:search2_C7614FF8_B1F4_4682_B652_1C2D5D133B13"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The woman agreed without a glimpse of hesitation. ⟪k:6⟫And so I "
"pricked the tip of my finger with a knife and let the blood drip into her mouth.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"Within three days, her health had improved enough for her to get out of bed unassisted.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Seeing that, no one in the village doubted my powers any longer. ⟪k:14⟫In fact, "
"the man who had accused me of being “the daughter of a charlatan” was subsequently punished for "
"his sins. ⟪k:15⟫He received much-deserved retribution for challenging the daughter of God—for "
"mocking her.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫But of course, being a saint, I forgave the man. ⟪k:20⟫He, in "
"turn, repented and changed his ways, worshiping me as the true child of God."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫A mulher concordou sem um vislumbre de hesitação. ⟪k:6⟫E então eu "
"espetei a ponta do dedo com uma faca e deixei o sangue escorrer em sua boca.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Em "
"três dias, sua saúde havia melhorado o suficiente para ela sair da cama sem ajuda.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Vendo isso, ninguém na aldeia duvidou mais dos meus poderes. ⟪k:14⟫Na verdade, o "
"homem que me acusou de ser “a filha de uma charlatã” foi posteriormente punido por seus pecados. "
"⟪k:15⟫Ele recebeu uma retribuição muito merecida por desafiar a filha de Deus—por zombar dela."
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Mas claro, sendo uma santa, eu perdoei o homem. ⟪k:20⟫Ele, por sua vez, "
"se arrependeu e mudou seus caminhos, adorando-me como a verdadeira filha de Deus."

#: search2:search2_40CC0FB9_61BE_47BD_8D74_485C3F68759F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d8a51517e4f1fc542a813cc4d64fc0fb1db84b6c929d231a1e3a890e44ef936
#. default-sha256: 3bacce1f6b563834cade2ea0fa867efae462a72bf2977a66fab39afaa04cdacd
msgctxt "search2:search2_40CC0FB9_61BE_47BD_8D74_485C3F68759F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Now, I’ll be honest with you—⟪k:2⟫I was ecstatic. ⟪k:3⟫Utterly elated. ⟪k:4⟫I felt like "
"I was on top of the world, and I reveled in it.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The villagers showered me with "
"adulation. ⟪k:8⟫They revered me—the daughter of God. ⟪k:9⟫Anyone who didn’t was punished.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫And on top of that, my blood could cause miracles.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Tell me, do you "
"look down on me for feeling the way I did? ⟪k:16⟫The ⟪k:17⟫actual⟪k:18⟫ child of God would never "
"let herself be consumed by such base emotions, would she?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Agora, vou ser honesta com você—⟪k:2⟫eu estava em êxtase. ⟪k:3⟫Completamente exultante. "
"⟪k:4⟫Eu senti como se estivesse no topo do mundo e me deleitei com isso.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Os aldeões "
"me encheram de adulação. ⟪k:8⟫Eles me reverenciavam—a filha de Deus. ⟪k:9⟫Quem não o fizesse era "
"punido.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫E ainda por cima, meu sangue podia fazer milagres.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Diga-"
"me, você me despreza por me sentir do jeito que eu me sentia? ⟪k:16⟫A ⟪k:17⟫verdadeira⟪k:18⟫ "
"filha de Deus jamais se deixaria consumir por emoções tão vis, não é?"

#: search2:search2_77934C7F_F599_4009_A939_24713B872DAC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4328f74efd132adff015313ff1d3725a14d2ab849e2c0c97051c340a9219bb36
#. default-sha256: 3c8847f41a5750665ee0c74789696991d95537122d986a815ad98b78bb12b616
msgctxt "search2:search2_77934C7F_F599_4009_A939_24713B872DAC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It is not my place to decide whether my blood truly had miraculous powers or not. ⟪k:2⟫"
"If you think it did, then it did, and if you think it was all happenstance, then so it was.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Miracles are brought about by faith... ⟪k:6⟫so the elderly woman who was healed was "
"done so by the power of her own belief. ⟪k:7⟫Baseless hope and desire can, at times, make the "
"otherwise impossible reality.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫You understand just how major a role religion "
"played in our time, don’t you, Michel? ⟪k:12⟫Especially as someone whose life was taken from him "
"in the name of God.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫And you understand how powerful word of mouth can be as "
"well, don’t you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Não estou em posição de decidir se meu sangue realmente tinha poderes milagrosos ou "
"não. ⟪k:2⟫Se você acha que tinha, então tinha, e se você acha que foi tudo casualidade, então foi."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Milagres são realizados pela fé... ⟪k:6⟫então a mulher idosa que foi curada, o foi "
"pelo poder de sua própria crença. ⟪k:7⟫A esperança sem fundamento e o desejo podem, às vezes, "
"tornar realidade o, de outra forma, impossível.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Você entende o papel "
"importante que a religião desempenhou em nosso tempo, não é, Michel? ⟪k:12⟫Especialmente como "
"alguém cuja vida foi tirada dele em nome de Deus.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫E você também entende como o "
"boca a boca pode ser poderoso, não é?"

#: search2:search2_F7235EA6_F32F_435D_93D6_4B66D7802AD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17a383861acdcff4110b7708ed40ba4489a4e202862e780cf8b62489af7ecc42
#. default-sha256: 28b02ebe9e7c66dc31982deca3a323b5a77d25f4d0d904942f570585e24c96c1
msgctxt "search2:search2_F7235EA6_F32F_435D_93D6_4B66D7802AD2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There were some for whom no miracle took place, but whenever that would happen the "
"villagers would come out and say, “The daughter of God is not to blame; you simply lack "
"sufficient faith.” ⟪k:2⟫Thus, such incidents had no negative effect on my reputation as a saint."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫For three years, I continued doling out blessings."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Houve alguns com quem nenhum milagre aconteceu, mas sempre que isso acontecia, os "
"aldeões apareciam e diziam, “A filha de Deus não tem culpa; você simplesmente não tem fé "
"suficiente.” ⟪k:2⟫Assim, tais incidentes não tinham nenhum efeito negativo em minha reputação de "
"santa.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Por três anos, continuei distribuindo bênçãos."

#: search2:search2_4297A524_1A44_4DFC_8149_BC08F0C17B25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26acd8a37b63fbaa9d546d83182f2603099667ef321f5418e380baa3de7cf3e1
#. default-sha256: 512ed3c6e350d96a6158f6fb32a7b86356e770253f8dd9376804aa035d91e536
msgctxt "search2:search2_4297A524_1A44_4DFC_8149_BC08F0C17B25"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫One day, while I was offering a prayer, my mother let slip her discontent:⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫“Why must you hand out miracles for nothing? ⟪k:5⟫Why must you give strangers grace? ⟪k:6⟫We "
"should be getting compensated. ⟪k:7⟫We ⟪k:8⟫deserve⟪k:9⟫ remuneration. ⟪k:10⟫If we charged just a "
"little bit for each blessing, we could be living so much more comfortably.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Um dia, enquanto eu fazia uma oração, minha mãe deixou escapar seu descontentamento:"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Por que você deve distribuir milagres por nada? ⟪k:5⟫Por que você deve dar graça "
"a estranhos? ⟪k:6⟫Deveríamos ser compensados. ⟪k:7⟫Nós ⟪k:8⟫merecemos⟪k:9⟫ remuneração. ⟪k:10⟫Se "
"cobrássemos um pouco por cada bênção, poderíamos viver com muito mais conforto.”"

#: search2:search2_7E03B668_2332_464F_A3C6_D3A85FD3F6C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2a748e446407808059147e983e2decaf070adbed1082540a227478c89840f9b
#. default-sha256: 3e2ad12c5881cb4628b22f4e9740d908752dd9ac3380c7c1b8abbeabc4e1fcdd
msgctxt "search2:search2_7E03B668_2332_464F_A3C6_D3A85FD3F6C7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was dumbfounded. ⟪k:2⟫How could the mother of a saint say such things? ⟪k:3⟫Helping "
"people was my divine calling—and she expected ⟪k:4⟫payment⟪k:5⟫?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I nearly wept, "
"hearing my mother preoccupied with such worldly desires.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫So I explained to "
"her how important this work was. ⟪k:13⟫I taught her that we were not to covet material wealth, "
"that we were to dedicate our lives to the service of our fellow man.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫“You’re "
"right, my dear saint,” she said, understanding.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫And I believed her. I fell "
"asleep that night convinced she truly understood and that there would be no more problems."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Fiquei pasma. ⟪k:2⟫Como pode a mãe de uma santa dizer essas coisas? ⟪k:3⟫Ajudar as "
"pessoas era meu chamado divino—e ela esperava ⟪k:4⟫pagamento⟪k:5⟫?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Eu quase chorei, "
"ouvindo minha mãe preocupada com tais desejos mundanos.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Então expliquei a "
"ela o quanto esse trabalho era importante. ⟪k:13⟫Eu ensinei a ela que não devemos cobiçar riqueza "
"material, que devemos dedicar nossas vidas ao serviço ao nosso próximo.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫“Você "
"está certa, minha querida santa,” ela disse, entendendo.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫E eu acreditei nela. "
"Adormeci naquela noite convencida de que ela realmente entendia e que não haveria mais problemas."

#: search2:search2_28E35D2F_DBEC_4F37_B683_34DDBD18D58B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6939a60cdacb24d70954fbb657d6a2ce62d0c5bc92e93d6b53a90a54b5dec33
#. default-sha256: 151dddf11ac56b80156dd086f7ab07e6b7a1ac2e17c2fa583aadb1a5d0718197
msgctxt "search2:search2_28E35D2F_DBEC_4F37_B683_34DDBD18D58B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I decided it was a trial.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫My Father, the Lord God, was testing my "
"worthiness of being⟪k:5⟫His daughter. ⟪k:6⟫So I choked back my urge to cry and sat there in "
"silent contemplation.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫For almost three weeks was I rocked around in the "
"carriage.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The coachman treated me well enough, but I’m certain it was only because he "
"didn’t want his precious cargo dying before he could⟪k:13⟫deliver it. ⟪k:14⟫He did not, by any "
"means, think me the child of God."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu decidi que era uma prova.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Meu Pai, o Senhor Deus, estava testando "
"minha dignidade de ser⟪k:5⟫Sua filha. ⟪k:6⟫Então eu sufoquei minha vontade de chorar e sentei em "
"silente contemplação.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Por quase três semanas eu fui sacudida na carruagem."
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫O cocheiro me tratou bem, mas tenho certeza de que foi apenas porque ele não queria "
"que sua preciosa carga morresse antes que ele pudesse⟪k:13⟫entregá-la. ⟪k:14⟫Ele não me "
"considerou, de forma alguma, a filha de Deus."

#: search2:search2_406D943E_A177_4E51_A89A_1E6647B3CCB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b699e95b14d753c41e595f3943ca2da5a57210a8fea86809bc5d55ff9045035
#. default-sha256: d715e725afde0dd5fca95d91b96a55082f8bab67da35c4bcb222855f9e2d21a3
msgctxt "search2:search2_406D943E_A177_4E51_A89A_1E6647B3CCB7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Welcome, daughter of God.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You’ll be performing miracles for me now.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Bem vinda, filha de Deus.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Você vai realizar milagres para mim agora.”"

#: search2:search2_5E3A5AA6_16B8_479F_A263_8C4A5CA62EF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecf4c568ef05fdf8296dc8666d2415dcd9152e944c3be017fa2868f0e22404e9
#. default-sha256: 01d0025abca72ea9aa30cf0771c86192171df0331acbd5beb39d34b8d014539c
msgctxt "search2:search2_5E3A5AA6_16B8_479F_A263_8C4A5CA62EF8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Miracles are not something to be performed for one single person’s benefit,” ⟪k:2⟫I "
"replied, shocked and furious he had just said something so utterly blasphemous.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫In "
"response, he said, “I ⟪k:6⟫bought⟪k:7⟫ you. You are my property. You have no right to an "
"opinion.”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫But I would not have any of it. I entreated him to give up his indulgent "
"lifestyle and devote himself to the service of the Lord.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫But the more I "
"pleaded, the deeper the creases on his face grew.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Thinking back on it now, it "
"was hardly surprising. ⟪k:18⟫A nine-year-old girl was scolding the most powerful man in the "
"region. ⟪k:19⟫I believed it was my duty, and that I was only doing what was right, but he surely "
"saw it as incredible arrogance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Milagres não são algo a ser realizado para o benefício de uma única pessoa,” ⟪k:2⟫eu "
"respondi, chocada e furiosa por ele ter acabado de dizer algo tão blasfemo.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Em "
"resposta, ele disse, “Eu ⟪k:6⟫comprei⟪k:7⟫ você. É minha propriedade. Você não tem direito a "
"opinião.”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Mas eu não aceitaria isso. Roguei-lhe que abandonasse seu estilo de vida "
"indulgente e se dedicasse ao serviço do Senhor.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Mas quanto mais eu "
"implorava, mais profundas as rugas em seu rosto cresciam.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Pensando nisso agora, "
"não era surpreendente. ⟪k:18⟫Uma menina de nove anos estava repreendendo o homem mais poderoso da "
"região. ⟪k:19⟫Eu acreditava que era meu dever e que estava apenas fazendo o que era certo, mas "
"ele certamente via isso como uma arrogância incrível."

#: search2:search2_1A678B86_7D11_4FDA_844C_469738277C30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c53b8a794ac20262a7869d682e007a3eb617880b42e5590e08e1d7b870add877
#. default-sha256: a2906181d7d76b2d26ccaa399e95e8be1766b8b3abf75913c749bd34e522d785
msgctxt "search2:search2_1A678B86_7D11_4FDA_844C_469738277C30"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“A saint’s blood and good fortune to all!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Sangue de uma santa e boa sorte a todos!”"

#: search2:search2_17960355_07F9_4DB3_8BAE_2E363F7AEE82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62f1b9247b46055dd746bc6bb770b7a347c1abf1dc2d687c8a899271bc4e0e58
#. default-sha256: 6fb077fbcd473525f50e15cf92532b90c68b565962ed7f4b9070a0d19ae18037
msgctxt "search2:search2_17960355_07F9_4DB3_8BAE_2E363F7AEE82"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫That was when I realized, ⟪k:6⟫the lord was only interested in the "
"approval of others. ⟪k:7⟫He reveled in their envy as he pranced about, showing off his curious "
"new toy—⟪k:8⟫me.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫He didn’t need my miracles.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Neither he, nor any "
"of his guests were afflicted with disease or misfortune. ⟪k:15⟫They were all richly blessed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Foi quando percebi que, ⟪k:6⟫o lorde só estava interessado na "
"aprovação dos outros. ⟪k:7⟫Se deleitava com a inveja deles enquanto saltitava, exibindo seu "
"curioso novo brinquedo—⟪k:8⟫eu.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ele não precisava dos meus milagres.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫Nem ele nem nenhum de seus convidados era aflito por doenças ou infortúnios. ⟪k:15⟫Eles "
"eram ricamente abençoados."

#: search2:search2_392C0EAA_FE9E_45BB_9F37_E954A3C2F803
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2cad76dab653e1ca1cb68580c5fa3b9e29a45f443a088f3d402e5c20c684bfba
#. default-sha256: 791424a2664b231c751c4c156deae0d14e18bf1140a1537ce544e5fa1845673d
msgctxt "search2:search2_392C0EAA_FE9E_45BB_9F37_E954A3C2F803"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫For a while, I was convinced it was all God’s test.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That it was part of "
"His plan for me, His daughter.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫That if I could make it through this trial, I would "
"be allowed to go back to helping people.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫That man would celebrate my success. Envy "
"me. Worship me.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫That sinners would face punishment.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫That divine "
"retribution would be delivered unto all who had wronged me, a saint.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫With "
"each passing day, my spirit grew more twisted."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Por um tempo, eu estava convencida de que tudo era um teste de Deus.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Que "
"fazia parte de Seu plano para mim, Sua filha.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Que se eu pudesse passar por esta "
"prova, eu poderia voltar a ajudar as pessoas.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Aquele homem celebraria meu sucesso. "
"Me Invejaria. Me adoraria.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Que os pecadores enfrentariam punição.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Que retribuição divina seria entregue a todos os que me prejudicaram, uma santa.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫"
"⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫A cada dia que passava, meu espírito ficava mais distorcido."

#: search2:search2_BF09B8E4_2AFD_44B8_B239_F40919211AA7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b490c5af5ca4c7fd0c8e832c0c70b96ce763e71da9d259b439ad85fcb2707c46
#. default-sha256: c8657f5d008992749c5a9e90b6d9a804bf56527d88e19228fec25017d453d501
msgctxt "search2:search2_BF09B8E4_2AFD_44B8_B239_F40919211AA7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Would anyone have believed that scarred and bloodied girl tied up on the floor in the "
"banquet hall was a ⟪k:2⟫saint⟪k:3⟫? ⟪k:4⟫Unlikely. This was no charitable gathering, but an "
"unholy sabbat.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Perhaps it was caused by my corrupted spirit. ⟪k:9⟫Perhaps it "
"was my heart’s way of crying for help. ⟪k:10⟫Or perhaps it was the Devil giving me my witch’s "
"mark. ⟪k:11⟫But no matter what the cause, during one of the bloody banquets, I underwent a "
"transformation.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫I was half-conscious, as usual, when one of the guests pointed "
"at me and shouted something. ⟪k:15⟫His face went pale, as if he were afraid, which I found quite "
"curious. ⟪k:16⟫The lord then approached me, grabbing me by the hair and lifting my head. ⟪k:17⟫He "
"yelled something, but I was too far gone to be able to make out what he was saying."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Alguém teria acreditado que aquela garota com cicatrizes e ensanguentada, amarrada no "
"chão do salão de banquetes, era uma ⟪k:2⟫santa⟪k:3⟫? ⟪k:4⟫Improvável. Esta não era uma reunião de "
"caridade, mas um sabá profano.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Talvez tenha sido causado pelo meu espírito "
"corrompido. ⟪k:9⟫Talvez fosse a maneira do meu coração chorar por ajuda. ⟪k:10⟫Ou talvez tenha "
"sido o Diabo me dando minha marca de bruxa. ⟪k:11⟫Mas não importa qual tenha sido a causa, "
"durante um dos banquetes sangrentos, eu sofri uma transformação.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Eu estava meio "
"inconsciente, como sempre, quando um dos convidados apontou para mim e gritou alguma coisa. ⟪k:15⟫"
"Seu rosto ficou pálido, como se ele estivesse com medo, o que achei bastante curioso. ⟪k:16⟫O "
"lorde então se aproximou de mim, agarrando-me pelos cabelos e levantando minha cabeça. ⟪k:17⟫Ele "
"gritou alguma coisa, mas eu estava longe demais para conseguir entender o que ele estava dizendo."

#: search2:search2_C3A74CDE_C593_47E5_85D2_8597EA077908
