#: search2:search2_C21895CE_0E48_4EC9_918C_4252AD916AAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 157e8a18ba45d30265b8d8773ac9f92146078adaae31353ad5125ee30d4c8443
#. default-sha256: e799f89a501dffc30fce1b8779a478c64b0e1a94265bec3092fdb24147723f96
