#: search2:search2_9FC511EB_2983_49FF_96C9_3B45F0C94B09
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 411941eb2a3a9b4568eaedea585c426bbde3a715b123b14571fded99dbbfdfec
#. default-sha256: f9dd87ae6faac00d8d74db5abdb6285a67f5c88852cb526c39ae99c780cab06c
msgctxt "search2:search2_9FC511EB_2983_49FF_96C9_3B45F0C94B09"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫“You’re a damned witch wearing a saint’s skin!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫“Você "
"é uma maldita bruxa vestindo a pele de uma santa!”"

#: search2:search2_B5C94E70_7F00_4F2E_9FF5_97F840DD1E68
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b2f0f9ffdc54d563f30b8bf8917988e9de5b8add23b381029911f8ba4c0971a
#. default-sha256: 5a21bdcb77befeba82c7a3d7d6f6cbfc566993450028e07d4d7e8d095a39dde4
msgctxt "search2:search2_B5C94E70_7F00_4F2E_9FF5_97F840DD1E68"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Maybe if I ⟪k:2⟫had⟪k:3⟫ died then, ⟪k:4⟫I wouldn’t have become the witch you know now. "
"⟪k:5⟫But that’s all conjecture.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Theorizing about what ⟪k:9⟫could⟪k:10⟫ have "
"happened is an exercise in futility."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Talvez se eu ⟪k:2⟫tivesse⟪k:3⟫ morrido então, ⟪k:4⟫eu não teria me tornado a bruxa que "
"você conhece agora. ⟪k:5⟫Mas isso é tudo conjectura.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Teorizar sobre o que ⟪k:9⟫"
"poderia⟪k:10⟫ ter acontecido é um exercício de futilidade."

#: search2:search2_A2B20511_D010_4E29_89C3_F2263B0A6C77
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b9bf1e69d1c961941b7702270d5bdca0da590d4d633942789265ca66b8b7b71
#. default-sha256: a8b8d586dd99cc8802a72d0ad8ecdf2d5082467c034dd5e12ed2202a2a127353
msgctxt "search2:search2_A2B20511_D010_4E29_89C3_F2263B0A6C77"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But no, I did not die that day.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Brought together by constant "
"mistreatment, the lord’s slaves chose that moment to start their revolt. ⟪k:5⟫When he swung down "
"his blade, someone bumped into him and it was knocked off its course.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I didn’t "
"have the strength to get to my feet, so I simply watched the chaos unfold before my hazy eyes. "
"⟪k:10⟫It never even occurred to me that I should try to escape.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫At some "
"point during the riot, a young man—one of the slaves—grabbed me by my bloody, limp arm and led me "
"out of the lord’s manor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mas não, eu não morri naquele dia.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Únidos por constantes maus-tratos, os "
"escravos do lorde escolheram aquele momento para iniciar sua revolta. ⟪k:5⟫Quando ele baixou sua "
"lâmina, alguém esbarrou nele e ela foi desviado de seu curso.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Eu não tinha "
"forças para me levantar, então simplesmente observei o caos se desenrolar diante de meus olhos "
"nebulosos. ⟪k:10⟫Nunca nem me ocorreu que eu deveria tentar escapar.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Em "
"algum momento durante o motim, um jovem—um dos escravos—agarrou-me pelo meu braço ensanguentado e "
"flácido e me levou para fora da mansão do lorde."

#: search2:search2_3785C6ED_3C88_4502_9EEE_CA220C2BA32E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bcf3510a2723c52f971190593fe150a43054bc17843e8ea58db356ec61dfb72
#. default-sha256: 2659a273603d3e6e5429aaebe5134a6f35d9801d2ce283646a7999c47a9af294
msgctxt "search2:search2_3785C6ED_3C88_4502_9EEE_CA220C2BA32E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The young man brought me to a slum—a place where the people banded together in their "
"hardship, barely scraping together enough to eat every day, let alone pay the taxes demanded of "
"them.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫By the time we had arrived at a small brothel located a ways into the slum, "
"the fog was starting to clear from my mind. ⟪k:5⟫I knew where we were, and feeling the gazes of "
"those scantily clothed women, I trembled.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫In a sense, that was possibly the "
"most frightened I had ever been in my life—despite everything else I had been through. ⟪k:10⟫The "
"idea that I had fallen so far I would have to become a prostitute scared me to death."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O jovem me levou a uma favela—um lugar onde as pessoas se reuniam em suas dificuldades, "
"mal conseguindo juntar o suficiente para comer todos os dias, muito menos pagar os impostos "
"exigidos deles.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫No momento em que chegamos a um pequeno bordel localizado no meio "
"da favela, a névoa estava começando a se dissipar da minha mente. ⟪k:5⟫Eu sabia onde estávamos e, "
"sentindo os olhares daquelas mulheres com pouca roupa, tremi.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫De certa forma, "
"foi possivelmente o maior medo que já senti em toda a minha vida—apesar de tudo o que eu já havia "
"passado. ⟪k:10⟫A ideia de que eu tinha caído tanto que teria que me tornar uma prostituta "
"mortalmente me assustou."

#: search2:search2_6853B0A8_FB9D_4D4F_9722_B38286C2B0CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4aabd2feafd30cb740e777dffd1775bddc5ca4beeeaf2136836afea4f839bb3e
#. default-sha256: 7fcfa3252d150b44c3e4ba497fe3e8b94e4a18681c0bef52b16146c3da39f745
msgctxt "search2:search2_6853B0A8_FB9D_4D4F_9722_B38286C2B0CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He said he knew someone here—someone I could trust—and that she would give me a room. "
"⟪k:2⟫I had trouble believing him, though.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I couldn’t trust the word of a prostitute—⟪k:5⟫"
"someone who valued money more than her own body.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫It was all a trap, I was "
"sure. ⟪k:10⟫One day, they would tell me I had to work. ⟪k:11⟫Nothing he said would convince me "
"otherwise.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Apparently sensing my mistrust, the slave gave me an apologetic frown "
"and handed me a mirror, saying, “Even if I did, you couldn’t get any work looking like that.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ele disse que conhecia alguém aqui—alguém em quem eu podia confiar—e que ela me daria "
"um quarto. ⟪k:2⟫Eu tive dificuldade em acreditar nele, no entanto.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu não podia confiar "
"na palavra de uma prostituta—⟪k:5⟫alguém que valorizava mais o dinheiro do que seu próprio corpo."
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Era tudo uma armadilha, eu tinha certeza. ⟪k:10⟫Um dia, eles me diriam que eu "
"tinha que trabalhar. ⟪k:11⟫Nada do que ele dissesse me convenceria do contrário.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"Aparentemente percebendo minha desconfiança, o escravo me deu uma careta de desculpas e me "
"entregou um espelho, dizendo: “Mesmo se eu estivesse, você não conseguiria nenhum trabalho assim.”"

#: search2:search2_33D52413_72C8_4B0A_975E_AB0831FF8C46
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20c008d90677c9973babddb4eda1ff135ca80378b236e572d0fa63beec4c21d4
#. default-sha256: aae2e6cf79b3255a8a8b34e63ce71ac629480a67cc50baf3cba3c4e96ee266dd
msgctxt "search2:search2_33D52413_72C8_4B0A_975E_AB0831FF8C46"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I could not believe what I saw.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That couldn’t be my face.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"It had to be an illusion.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫There was no way.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫That was not the face "
"of a saint.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫It ⟪k:17⟫couldn’t⟪k:18⟫ be.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫It wasn’t real—it "
"wasn’t possible."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Não pude acreditar no que vi.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Isso não poderia ser o meu rosto.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫Tinha que ser uma ilusão.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Não havia como.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Isso não era o "
"rosto de uma santa.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Não podia⟪k:18⟫ ser.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Não era real—não "
"era possível."

#: search2:search2_5FFAA84C_624C_43B0_8861_5ECBC3D23228
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6174702126385839f0b2c1699e2707b641992c389a33f61b15ea3f614acdacd
#. default-sha256: 70ba68bd01ba69a488b8841a9bff9521587cd8b3ca87f01bafe0d045c119de25
msgctxt "search2:search2_5FFAA84C_624C_43B0_8861_5ECBC3D23228"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Patches of skin had fallen off my face, exposing the raw, red flesh beneath. ⟪k:2⟫It "
"looked quite similar to what had been done to my arms and legs, ⟪k:3⟫except my face had never "
"been cut before.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Looking at myself in the mirror, even ⟪k:8⟫I⟪k:9⟫ doubted my "
"own sainthood. ⟪k:10⟫The thing in my reflection was a hellish abomination. ⟪k:11⟫It was the "
"twisted face of a witch.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫And although I was shocked by what I saw, at the same "
"time, it answered several lingering questions. ⟪k:15⟫It explained why the lord and his guests had "
"panicked at the sight of me, ⟪k:16⟫and it also explained why he had said I was “a witch wearing a "
"saint’s skin.”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Over the course of the dozens of banquets I had participated in, "
"my face must have mutated.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Twisted into this ugly, ⟪k:24⟫sickening, ⟪k:25⟫"
"monstrous thing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Pedaços de pele caíram do meu rosto, expondo a carne vermelha e crua por baixo. ⟪k:2⟫ "
"Parecia bastante semelhante ao que havia sido feito em meus braços e pernas, ⟪k:3⟫ exceto que meu "
"rosto nunca havia sido cortado antes.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Olhando no espelho, até ⟪k:8⟫eu⟪k:9⟫ "
"duvidei da minha própria santidade. ⟪k:10⟫A coisa em meu reflexo era uma abominação infernal. "
"⟪k:11⟫Era o rosto retorcido de uma bruxa.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫E embora eu tenha ficado chocado com o "
"que vi, ao mesmo tempo, isso respondeu a várias perguntas que restavam. ⟪k:15⟫Isso explicava por "
"que o lorde e seus convidados entraram em pânico ao me ver, ⟪k:16⟫e também explicava por que ele "
"disse que eu era “uma bruxa vestindo a pele de uma santa.”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Ao longo das dezenas "
"de banquetes em que participei, meu rosto deve ter sofrido uma mutação.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫"
"Retorcido nesta coisa feia, ⟪k:24⟫repugnante, ⟪k:25⟫monstruosa."

#: search2:search2_42A499D1_7C1A_4176_BF13_E2A609DFF67B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab431f7fa697dcff2266c84bea08603614646e09ebf2e4dc63ad8b43ec6461e0
#. default-sha256: 5245aa69cd06fd1201e79b0f299cd2c557ad373e786aed7bceef894a741b1aed
msgctxt "search2:search2_42A499D1_7C1A_4176_BF13_E2A609DFF67B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The sight of what I had become sapped the last bit of willpower from me.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Not because I was particularly fond of my face or thought myself especially beautiful, ⟪k:5⟫but "
"because it crushed me to see everything “saintly” about me crumble away. ⟪k:6⟫Test from God or "
"otherwise, I didn’t have the strength left to attempt to overcome it.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Deciding I "
"would rather be dead than struggle any longer, I begged the slave to kill me. ⟪k:10⟫Taking one’s "
"own life was a sin; if I did that, I would not be able to return to my Father’s side, and I "
"wanted to ask Him why I had been put through such tribulation.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫But the "
"young man refused. ⟪k:15⟫He said, completely missing my intention, that if I persevered, good "
"fortune would eventually find me. He said that if I lived on, I would eventually have a chance to "
"get my payback.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫I had no such worldly concerns, though, but if no one would take "
"my life, I had no choice but to live."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A visão do que eu havia me tornado minou o último pedaço de força de vontade em mim."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Não porque eu gostasse particularmente do meu rosto ou me achasse especialmente "
"bonita, ⟪k:5⟫mas porque me destruiu ver tudo “santo” sobre mim desmoronar. ⟪k:6⟫Teste de Deus ou "
"não, não tive mais forças para tentar superá-lo.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Decidindo que preferia estar morta "
"a continuar lutando, implorei ao escravo que me matasse. ⟪k:10⟫Tirar a própria vida era pecado; "
"se eu fizesse isso, não poderia voltar para o lado de meu Pai, e eu queria perguntar a Ele por "
"que eu tinha sido posta em tal tribulação.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Mas o jovem recusou. ⟪k:15⟫Ele "
"disse, falhando completamente em entender minha intenção, que se eu perseverasse, boa sorte "
"acabaria por me encontrar. Ele disse que se eu continuasse viva, eventualmente teria a chance de "
"me vingar.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Não tinha essas preocupações mundanas, porém, mas se ninguém tirasse "
"minha vida, eu não tinha escolha a não ser viver."

#: search2:search2_3C2FC324_5E07_4C60_991E_F7B8CC62B4D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 320c352ee638c19e6684616e3a01763906742f1dad2f0bc8719e935c172f6ed1
#. default-sha256: 27e75109d87850ab8e927ccfc64d9da9b8fa304f9422cef0540006fd3af6730f
msgctxt "search2:search2_3C2FC324_5E07_4C60_991E_F7B8CC62B4D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Occasionally, the slave would drop in to check on me. ⟪k:2⟫The other men thought me "
"ghastly and wouldn’t get anywhere near me, but he was different. ⟪k:3⟫And every time he visited, "
"he would say, “One day, I’ll show you the world.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫And to tell you the truth, "
"⟪k:8⟫I was beginning to grow attached to it all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ocasionalmente, o escravo aparecia para me checar. ⟪k:2⟫Os outros homens me achavam "
"medonha e não chegavam perto de mim, mas ele era diferente. ⟪k:3⟫E toda vez que visitava, ele "
"dizia, “Um dia, eu vou te mostrar o mundo.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫E para dizer a verdade, ⟪k:7⟫eu estava "
"começando a me apegar a tudo isso."

#: search2:search2_1BC39E90_242B_47AE_ACBD_10120B407D12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f9c9dfcdbce8a1320151f6c3234e4b481243536c9f2d5e1e6b456a34e036109
#. default-sha256: b4f206e6d466e4a35ec63cd7aa140f1ea0f2a64c2516d8f46158a4ed41b65d2d
msgctxt "search2:search2_1BC39E90_242B_47AE_ACBD_10120B407D12"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Perhaps I ⟪k:2⟫could⟪k:3⟫ perform miracles, ⟪k:4⟫but that didn’t necessarily mean I had "
"to be the daughter of God or a saint. ⟪k:5⟫Maybe I was just a regular person... ⟪k:6⟫who happened "
"to possess some unusual abilities.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Ridiculous, isn’t it? ⟪k:11⟫Despite coming "
"to accept my humanity, I refused to let go of my miraculous powers. ⟪k:12⟫They were the last "
"thing protecting what I thought of as “myself.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫But to me at the time, it felt "
"like a very dramatic change of heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Talvez eu ⟪k:2⟫pudesse⟪k:3⟫ fazer milagres, ⟪k:4⟫mas isso não significava "
"necessariamente que eu tinha que ser filha de Deus ou uma santa. ⟪k:5⟫Talvez eu fosse apenas uma "
"pessoa normal... ⟪k:6⟫que acabou por ter algumas habilidades incomuns.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"Ridículo, não é? ⟪k:11⟫Apesar de aceitar minha humanidade, recusei-me a abrir mão de meus poderes "
"milagrosos. ⟪k:12⟫Eles eram a última coisa que protegia o que eu considerava “eu mesma.”⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Mas para mim, na época, parecia uma mudança muito dramática de coração."

#: search2:search2_7B446C25_542C_4B30_B77A_C31F37847906
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb8c6c6d56f63270f1274d7e23ba3232f968123a47b9318a9adc1187f9b87ca7
#. default-sha256: b9a56eddf1bf36974308e6eda43b1d22402ef2b2c181361b4954bf0293ab044c
msgctxt "search2:search2_7B446C25_542C_4B30_B77A_C31F37847906"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Three years after the revolt at the lord’s manor, I had my twelfth birthday, for which "
"they threw me a little dinner party. ⟪k:2⟫The women all pitched in to bake me treats, and the "
"young slave man was there too.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I was happy. ⟪k:7⟫I thought that if life could "
"continue on like this, I was fine with not going back to being a saint."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Três anos depois da revolta no feudo do lorde, fiz 12 anos, para o qual me ofereceram "
"um pequeno jantar. ⟪k:2⟫ Todas as mulheres se juntaram para me assar guloseimas, e o jovem "
"escravo também estava lá.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Eu estava feliz. ⟪k:7⟫Eu pensei que se a vida "
"pudesse continuar assim, eu estava bem em não voltar a ser uma santa."

#: search2:search2_F2E1F7D1_5100_44A1_858B_66767D4E66C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a471d5196608a4e437c09c0484411b4a4bb5e8133057bae498b869878f2fe9df
#. default-sha256: 447e2b20143b8eddca245a30246ef0bf880b653390aa62e8c52b7a0fda8e7790
msgctxt "search2:search2_F2E1F7D1_5100_44A1_858B_66767D4E66C4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Let me tell you what happened that night.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫On the night of my birthday "
"celebration, bandits attacked the brothel. ⟪k:5⟫Now, bandits were hardly a rarity in that time, "
"so everyone was always on the lookout, and we never went out at night. ⟪k:6⟫They wouldn’t stop at "
"robbing you either; ⟪k:7⟫they were armed with blades and would frequently kill their targets if "
"necessary.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫But cautious as we were, we were helpless against a direct raid.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫The brothel fell into a panic, screams echoing in the night."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Deixe-me contar o que aconteceu naquela noite.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Na noite da festa do meu "
"aniversário, bandidos atacaram o bordel. ⟪k:5⟫Agora, bandidos dificilmente eram uma raridade "
"naquela época, então todos estavam sempre atentos e nunca saíamos à noite. ⟪k:6⟫Eles não parariam "
"em apenas roubar você, também; ⟪k:7⟫andavam armados com lâminas e frequentemente matavam seus "
"alvos, se necessário.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Mas por mais cautelosos que fossemos, éramos impotentes "
"contra um ataque direto.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫O bordel entrou em pânico, gritos ecoando na noite."

#: search2:search2_C0277943_3A04_4B04_9E30_551311929631
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b87dd757acb89d0a056d1c38569b763ab9ed633fe9ab115ccb9b5aff918fe3d
#. default-sha256: 3b15241a409a39073afdd900498718a661d3254f24e8971ca428044a806ac1a0
msgctxt "search2:search2_C0277943_3A04_4B04_9E30_551311929631"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The customers were carved up and left for dead.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The women were bound and "
"stowed away to be sold.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫My peaceful world shattered in an instant.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"And the next thing I knew, I was some slave trader’s merchandise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Os clientes foram esquartejados e deixados para morrer.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫As mulheres foram "
"amarradas e guardadas para serem vendidas.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Meu mundo pacífico despedaçado em um "
"instante.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫E do nada, eu era a mercadoria de algum comerciante de escravos."

#: search2:search2_847C87FC_1F7A_4271_A04C_1F8DEA58AAE0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01f0b7db4980d36e292e0c4d3fba0883d354cfff45e8c4d0e41f6b90cf21f25f
#. default-sha256: f66d31bc15e59c2c0a3506cb0c58b991ec1e22a8b9e25ba815e5c0963984efac
msgctxt "search2:search2_847C87FC_1F7A_4271_A04C_1F8DEA58AAE0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I don’t know what became of the prostitutes who cared for me or the slave who brought "
"me to them. ⟪k:2⟫I assume the women were sold and the young man slaughtered. ⟪k:3⟫But regardless, "
"I found myself being rocked around in the back of a carriage once more."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Não sei o que aconteceu com as prostitutas que cuidaram de mim ou com o escravo que me "
"trouxe até elas. ⟪k:2⟫Presumo que as mulheres foram vendidas e o jovem massacrado. ⟪k:3⟫Mas "
"independentemente disso, eu me vi sendo balançada na parte de trás de uma carruagem mais uma vez."

