#: search2:search2_7D97F3A4_2106_4FC1_9AB7_B7A82DF8D047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc4ba7a2ca387a1678f4cbfc0a9dc3b6c9ac2e38e2ce7870cfa294680744199f
#. default-sha256: aeb2784d554111344b3a01c8e97af2b6ec7d38c23d1d77b28d5f6d52bfadb553
msgctxt "search2:search2_7D97F3A4_2106_4FC1_9AB7_B7A82DF8D047"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The woman was a witch—⟪k:2⟫by trade, that is.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It appeared she had had a "
"deep knowledge of medicinal herbs, using it to make an assortment of medicines. ⟪k:6⟫In her "
"cabinets were dozens of small glass bottles containing dried, powdered leaves, and crushed "
"berries, among other things. ⟪k:7⟫On the fire was a cauldron, liquid bubbling inside.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The woman looked as though she was asleep. ⟪k:12⟫Presumably, she had passed away of "
"old age, for there was no sign bandits had been rooting through the cottage, and she had a look "
"of absolute serenity on her face.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Looking over at the woman’s dead body, I "
"didn’t cross myself.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I envied her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A mulher era uma bruxa—⟪k:2⟫por profissão, isto é.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Parecia que ela tinha "
"um profundo conhecimento de ervas medicinais, usando-as para fazer uma variedade de remédios. "
"⟪k:6⟫Em seus armários havia dezenas de pequenos frascos de vidro contendo folhas secas e em pó e "
"bagas trituradas, entre outras coisas. ⟪k:7⟫No fogo havia um caldeirão, líquido borbulhando "
"dentro.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫A mulher parecia estar dormindo. ⟪k:12⟫ Presumivelmente, ela havia "
"falecido de velhice, pois não havia sinal de que bandidos haviam vasculhando a cabana, e ela "
"tinha uma expressão de absoluta serenidade em seu rosto.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Olhando para o corpo "
"morto da mulher, eu não fiz o sinal da cruz.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Eu a invejei."

#: search2:search2_0A1E4F6B_9D14_401F_8E11_E461B7C25250
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b9dc4179647260678909d8c1e347fcac5881f36b58d358e02e6af7472d547e6
#. default-sha256: c4f985d3f731fb8609f606b280b7436f39da522ae62936eb6a03089a63fa70c1
msgctxt "search2:search2_0A1E4F6B_9D14_401F_8E11_E461B7C25250"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“My sister has fallen very ill, and she desperately needs medicine.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Minha irmã ficou muito doente e precisa desesperadamente de remédios.”"

#: search2:search2_5C1F80B5_C353_4B86_A024_558C35E11706
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbb1890dcc538fc1c31ba040979fad918689cf134f03de5f265cd365db0ef4cf
#. default-sha256: 2e34b1cd66f553dcf9ac2cf0a48e528381c78a38c99174c597dd8bfb5524a8f2
msgctxt "search2:search2_5C1F80B5_C353_4B86_A024_558C35E11706"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫According to him, his younger sister had fallen gravely ill, and though they had tried "
"a number of remedies, she was still bedridden. ⟪k:2⟫The medicines I gave him too had no effect, "
"but he persisted in his quest, visiting me again and again for new combinations to try.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫He wanted nothing more than to relieve even the slightest bit of his sister’s suffering. "
"⟪k:6⟫And, moved by his dedication to his family, I too wanted to do anything I could to help.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫For the first time in years, my world encompassed more than my small cottage."
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫When the young man came, he would ask not only for medicine—but to go on "
"walks with me. ⟪k:15⟫He ⟪k:16⟫volunteered⟪k:17⟫ to spend time with me, despite my horrifying "
"appearance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Segundo ele, sua irmã mais nova adoeceu gravemente e, embora tenham tentado vários "
"remédios, ela ainda estava acamada. ⟪k:2⟫ Os remédios que dei também não tiveram efeito, mas ele "
"persistiu em sua busca, visitando-me de novo e de novo para tentar novas combinações.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫Ele não queria nada mais do que ao menos aliviar o sofrimento de sua irmã. ⟪k:6⟫E, movida "
"por sua dedicação à família, eu também queria fazer tudo o que pudesse para ajudar.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫Pela primeira vez em anos, meu mundo abrangia mais do que minha pequena cabana.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Quando o jovem chegava, pedia não apenas por remédios—mas por caminhadas comigo "
"também. ⟪k:15⟫Ele ⟪k:16⟫se ofereceu⟪k:17⟫ para passar tempo comigo, apesar da minha aparência "
"horripilante."

#: search2:search2_244B3A92_0001_4CC4_831E_B498831F882E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac6f1c37735dd059d8b853b22a3e9b5c93079bd9eae6d93ebc64103b48bb9e7a
#. default-sha256: cdd75541f749dc9886b59276c712a43d5628440eccb091f5d36ba0533aedf830
msgctxt "search2:search2_244B3A92_0001_4CC4_831E_B498831F882E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“It’s not healthy to stay holed up inside all the time.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Não é saudável ficar escondido dentro de casa o tempo todo.”"

#: search2:search2_9F3D9F63_11CC_4A4B_AA1E_D8F0FFB4222A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f10f59fecc6ba7ad638c49ac19114a0456f35ce006df0808aa75bac9603d39a
#. default-sha256: ce6f4fa04e7ec05e8642e22a6feccd616309e382f1d16b5bc440704b6d03b758
msgctxt "search2:search2_9F3D9F63_11CC_4A4B_AA1E_D8F0FFB4222A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“You’ve got this beautiful lake right here.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫What do you say we take a "
"little walk around the shoreline?”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Você tem este lindo lago aqui.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫O que acha de darmos um pequeno passeio "
"ao redor da margem?”"

#: search2:search2_9FDE4F87_C30E_4ECA_85BE_22AEB9159F14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edc9f8ae17f8fba1d53d683c27e7c6962ecde1169d67c6bdbfca2d5ce3347d17
#. default-sha256: 2f4e77da120c68002b05862bcdcc09c165b75691e41a72ad38d8467ac99283d6
msgctxt "search2:search2_9FDE4F87_C30E_4ECA_85BE_22AEB9159F14"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He said with a smile, taking me by the hand.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We spoke as we circled the "
"lakeside. ⟪k:5⟫His voice was always soft and pleasant—like a ray of light shining through a crack "
"in the walls. ⟪k:6⟫When I was with him, I felt like I could be an actual ⟪k:7⟫person⟪k:8⟫. An "
"ordinary girl.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫He talked about his sister more than anything. ⟪k:13⟫And "
"whenever he did, he was at his brightest—and most melancholy.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫The young man had "
"been a member of a noble house, but disputes over who was the rightful heir had forced him and "
"his sister out. ⟪k:17⟫Shortly after that, his sister had fallen ill and was now bedridden."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ele disse com um sorriso, me pegando pela mão.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Conversamos enquanto "
"circulávamos a beira do lago. ⟪k:5⟫Sua voz era sempre suave e agradável—como um raio de luz "
"brilhando através de uma rachadura nas paredes. ⟪k:6⟫Quando eu estava com ele, senti que poderia "
"ser uma ⟪k:7⟫pessoa⟪k:8⟫ de verdade. Uma garota comum.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Ele falava sobre sua "
"irmã mais do que qualquer coisa. ⟪k:13⟫E sempre que o fazia, estava em seu estado mais brilhante—"
"e mais melancólico.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫O jovem era membro de uma casa nobre, mas as disputas sobre "
"quem era o herdeiro legítimo forçaram ele e sua irmã a sair. ⟪k:17⟫Pouco depois disso, sua irmã "
"adoeceu e agora estava acamada."

#: search2:search2_158883FF_2FA6_4886_B12D_DACD8C075266
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c110e4ca96b8808fd919ebc7c0338417a0ee978abc5e5c1a4bab29da57560a8
#. default-sha256: be1628004b4e8d0d00ff525e24bea39d726de08b2e7d70a2e3a67c6f418c1236
msgctxt "search2:search2_158883FF_2FA6_4886_B12D_DACD8C075266"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I’ll take anything at this point to make her better.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I’ll even take a "
"miracle if I can get one.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Neste ponto, vou aceitar qualquer coisa faça ela melhor.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Vou até aceitar "
"um milagre se conseguir um.”"

#: search2:search2_D35D0338_36F9_48EE_B187_CEDA1A5458C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c733db1550cac1bb4983d65fa6a3e955b66ad03e2a1256d809dbca1080891e51
#. default-sha256: c685e44443decdcde81822e016856e56c46b36b4e61894bb002c69df869ac9ed
msgctxt "search2:search2_D35D0338_36F9_48EE_B187_CEDA1A5458C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And he believed it all.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He led me to his house, where a pale, sickly "
"young girl lay in bed. ⟪k:5⟫She was a sweet little girl with the same flaxen hair as her brother "
"who looked like she would have been quite spirited if not for her ailment. ⟪k:6⟫It was touching "
"to see the two siblings sitting there together, quietly holding each other.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I "
"would gladly give my blood for the two of them.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫And so I made a new cut on my arm"
"—which had healed considerably thanks to the slave and the women of the brothel—⟪k:14⟫and let the "
"girl drink of my blood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E ele acreditou em tudo.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Me levou até sua casa, onde uma jovem pálida e "
"doente estava deitada na cama. ⟪k:5⟫Ela era uma garotinha doce com o mesmo cabelo linho de seu "
"irmão, que parecia que teria sido bastante espirituosa se não fosse por sua doença. ⟪k:6⟫Foi "
"comovente ver os dois irmãos sentados juntos, em silêncio, abraçados.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Eu "
"daria de bom grado meu sangue para eles dois.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫E então fiz um novo corte no braço—"
"que havia cicatrizado consideravelmente graças ao escravo e às mulheres do bordel—⟪k:14⟫e deixei "
"a garota beber do meu sangue."

#: search2:search2_48A4447F_5C21_460B_8E70_E23F3ED6183A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3031e2fea6f989c92cae1cfae4ce6b01e72110084903bc8468810778716fba36
#. default-sha256: 3338c7ba2ed69c55b7be49fffd64198d89a79c9a25d4bd0268d5337c6a9bdf2f
msgctxt "search2:search2_48A4447F_5C21_460B_8E70_E23F3ED6183A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nevertheless, I was prepared to give her my blood as many times⟪k:2⟫as needed. ⟪k:3⟫"
"Whenever her condition worsened, the young man came⟪k:4⟫to request more, and never once did I "
"turn him away. ⟪k:5⟫On the contrary,⟪k:6⟫I enthusiastically offered her my services.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫Over time, though, the hope in his eyes began to fade. ⟪k:10⟫He asked me on fewer walks, and "
"he seemed hesitant to look me in the eye.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫I assume it was out of discomfort"
"—out of guilt. ⟪k:15⟫Out of shame about asking for blood. ⟪k:16⟫But I don’t think his concerns "
"were for me—rather himself and his sister."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No entanto, eu estava preparada para dar a ela meu sangue quantas vezes fosse "
"necessário. ⟪k:2⟫Sempre que a condição dela piorava, o jovem vinha pedir mais, e nunca o recusei. "
"⟪k:3⟫Pelo contrário,⟪k:4⟫eu ofereci meus serviços a ela com entusiasmo.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Com o "
"tempo, porém, a esperança em seus olhos começou a desaparecer. ⟪k:8⟫Ele me convidava para menos "
"caminhadas e parecia hesitante em me olhar nos olhos.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Presumo que foi por "
"desconforto—por culpa. ⟪k:13⟫Por vergonha de pedir por sangue. ⟪k:14⟫Mas não acho que suas "
"preocupações eram comigo—e sim com ele e sua irmã."

#: search2:search2_763E66E1_DA9C_4FEA_9AD3_9DB28D9544E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 373061f0b4619136f54b5a5a5173f19bd637cce2a2b68be8eae527da6d6629f3
#. default-sha256: 908bb0a40a8929a6d4a98370752cb0411f9160cf7b404b367c73648d7435107a
msgctxt "search2:search2_763E66E1_DA9C_4FEA_9AD3_9DB28D9544E6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫As I mentioned earlier, blood was considered unclean in our time, ⟪k:2⟫and not only was "
"I giving mine away, I was having his sister imbibe it. ⟪k:3⟫Looking at it that way, it would "
"hardly be a surprise for him—or anyone else—to think what I was doing depraved.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫As "
"time passed, the flaxen-haired young man seemed to grow more and more disturbed by me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Como mencionei anteriormente, o sangue era considerado impuro em nosso tempo, ⟪k:2⟫e "
"não apenas eu estava doando o meu, mas também fazendo sua irmã beber dele. ⟪k:3⟫Olhando dessa "
"maneira, dificilmente seria uma surpresa ele—ou qualquer outra pessoa—pensar que o que eu estava "
"fazendo era depravado.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Com o passar do tempo, o jovem de cabelos linho parecia "
"ficar cada vez mais perturbado por mim."

#: search2:search2_1C519B13_2487_4002_9F45_09D54A474E6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1d6ce07819a91d3defb134dc7598b42ea13f8892bda42924626257d9d06186b
#. default-sha256: 83429dd7c1c05a49cd7dbf6098fe14cb34504e731218982a2e9152d4d899c658
msgctxt "search2:search2_1C519B13_2487_4002_9F45_09D54A474E6A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That was what I got for opening up.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That was what I got for letting his "
"kind, warm light shine in on me.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The moment things went bad, he pulled away.⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫There were times when I thought I shouldn’t have done anything in the first place, but "
"regardless, I held fast to my original decision. ⟪k:11⟫I would put myself on the line for them."
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫No one else. ⟪k:15⟫Just them.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Even if he was afraid of me or "
"had no interest in seeing me, ⟪k:19⟫I would continue offering her my blood.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫And "
"I was firm in my resolve."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Isso foi o que eu ganhei por me abrir.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Isso foi o que eu ganhei por "
"deixar sua luz gentil e quente brilhar sobre mim.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫No momento em que as coisas "
"ficaram ruins, ele se afastou.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Houve momentos em que pensei que não deveria ter "
"feito nada em primeiro lugar, mas independentemente disso, mantive minha decisão original. ⟪k:11⟫"
"Eu me arriscaria por eles.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ninguém mais. ⟪k:15⟫Só eles.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Mesmo "
"que ele tivesse medo de mim ou não tivesse interesse em me ver, ⟪k:19⟫eu continuaria oferecendo a "
"ela meu sangue.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫E eu estava firme em minha determinação."

#: search2:search2_39469C98_5F4C_4DA6_ACA6_64EDECCF52BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0bd356e05c83eb8bb8eb605974c12f5093d1e2f91f976528ad5a2ea6f99691d
#. default-sha256: de8b40a888a362bf54427e2f4ee829caf2bd958288fd879b6ffe9aa5e1897786
msgctxt "search2:search2_39469C98_5F4C_4DA6_ACA6_64EDECCF52BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫One day, though, I received a new visitor.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The young man was still the "
"only one I would show my face to—the only guest I had let into my walls. ⟪k:5⟫So, as usual, I "
"took the man’s request from behind the cottage door.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫But I could hardly believe my "
"ears when he began speaking."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Um dia, porém, recebi um novo visitante.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫O jovem ainda era o único para "
"quem eu mostraria meu rosto—o único convidado que eu deixara entrar em minhas paredes. ⟪k:5⟫"
"Então, como sempre, atendi o pedido do homem atrás da porta da cabana.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Mas mal pude "
"acreditar em meus ouvidos quando ele começou a falar."

#: search2:search2_3156177A_00F4_4897_B057_59460387FD13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b39f965885146c69385be0b7d976a96e18e4e01c57d3cba98f1afeb9a0572530
#. default-sha256: fac5704823f82f1b4d47ed57b483f0a06282cadaeb7e1ec42b2e409b6381a9d8
msgctxt "search2:search2_3156177A_00F4_4897_B057_59460387FD13"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Are you the witch with the miracle blood?”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Você é a bruxa com o sangue milagroso?”"

#: search2:search2_268BAB2C_F5A0_4FEF_A04F_0B20405C9255
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 576659b9951e07cc1253a68ea77d4d16b218b25364f5684fe12c1126a0d50099
#. default-sha256: 871cefea786c6de1b74a8f2486696fd69768d3cc556adf9770350c1a4f157e6d
msgctxt "search2:search2_268BAB2C_F5A0_4FEF_A04F_0B20405C9255"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫First, ⟪k:2⟫how did he know my blood had powers?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Second, ⟪k:6⟫why had he "
"called me a witch and not a saint?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Third, ⟪k:10⟫why did he sound like the man who "
"had slaughtered the slave carriage?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Primeiro, ⟪k:2⟫como ele sabia que meu sangue tinha poderes?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Segundo, ⟪k:6⟫"
"por que ele me chamou de bruxa e não de santa?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Terceiro, ⟪k:10⟫por que ele soou "
"como o homem que matou a carruagem de escravos?"

#: search2:search2_66E0D963_9AB6_450D_8F22_3BEE7CAF26F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f97f65559be502f863035b4c1692e85eff5595889a7880b008f2c0988ac063ba
#. default-sha256: 36e18a46c2f71237efda265b6750b0fa242dda3e7d483f7080a8fa6c606274f0
msgctxt "search2:search2_66E0D963_9AB6_450D_8F22_3BEE7CAF26F4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My blood was for the sick and needy. ⟪k:2⟫I would never spare a drop for a murderer "
"like him.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫And I told the man exactly that, demanding he leave.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫All I "
"could think about was the pile of bodies. The fountain of blood. ⟪k:9⟫The man drenched in "
"crimson, wearing a ghastly smirk. ⟪k:10⟫I trembled behind the door, fearing he may go on another "
"such rampage.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫But instead, he gave a simple, “As you say,” and went on his way."
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I let out a deep sigh of relief, ⟪k:18⟫which is when I realized tears "
"were rolling down both of my cheeks. ⟪k:19⟫Like an ordinary girl.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Three "
"days later, the flaxen-haired boy showed up at my cottage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Meu sangue era para os doentes e necessitados. ⟪k:2⟫Eu nunca distribuiria uma gota para "
"um assassino como ele.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫E eu disse exatamente isso ao homem, exigindo que ele fosse "
"embora.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Só conseguia pensar na pilha de corpos. A fonte de sangue. ⟪k:9⟫O homem "
"encharcado de carmesim, vestindo um sorriso medonho. ⟪k:10⟫Eu tremi atrás da porta, temendo que "
"ele pudesse entrar em outro frenesi.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Mas em vez disso, ele deu um simples, “Como "
"quiser,” e seguiu seu caminho.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Deixei escapar um profundo suspiro de "
"alívio, ⟪k:18⟫que foi quando percebi que lágrimas estavam rolando pelas minhas bochechas. ⟪k:19⟫"
"Como uma garota qualquer.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Três dias depois, o menino de cabelos linho "
"apareceu em minha casa."

#: search2:search2_4B7F9712_782D_488A_B202_AEF29E5E437C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f3b98d5aad98738b801de31bc00b05587f27237101ae02857c0ccb1ede6086d
#. default-sha256: 83722f0bd4103f03bc34b285ff6cadc5b9ba5299f6b8ea2982a1c0fbf35ec6e8
msgctxt "search2:search2_4B7F9712_782D_488A_B202_AEF29E5E437C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I’m sorry for being so distant lately...”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Me desculpe por estar tão distante ultimamente...”"

#: search2:search2_89A4710D_D668_40B6_8C0F_01EAD1C28449
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19f36ee883766c8d524da5e7e3f0da0a30e977126b5c743e81f5b51be6cc6408
#. default-sha256: 2aa36ec90d16666dd57cb31b8941800a61ebb37f60ad4538a252a786b974bffa
msgctxt "search2:search2_89A4710D_D668_40B6_8C0F_01EAD1C28449"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“I want to talk things over...”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Eu quero conversar sobre tudo...”"

#: search2:search2_63F5048A_D1A2_4E02_8327_9A92812FDF7C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddf5d8ccb3d5a341cf12fb727a1a634bff85b2f89d72f9367b254ab7071374dc
#. default-sha256: 59b82abf3f19208cf2b0cc9be5a29a0c442e3a2731db0a45829b7cd0a6d3c70a
msgctxt "search2:search2_63F5048A_D1A2_4E02_8327_9A92812FDF7C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Those two sentences were like a light shining from above.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I wanted to "
"talk to him too. ⟪k:5⟫I wanted to take a walk around the lake and listen to him talk about "
"nothing. ⟪k:6⟫I wanted to experience the warmth of his world once more. ⟪k:7⟫And I wanted to tell "
"him about the terrible man who had been there a few days earlier.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫About how scared "
"I had been.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫I wanted him to tell me it would be all right."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Essas duas frases foram como uma luz brilhando lá de cima.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu queria "
"falar com ele também. ⟪k:5⟫Eu queria dar uma volta no lago e ouvi-lo falar sobre nada. ⟪k:6⟫Eu "
"queria experimentar o calor de seu mundo mais uma vez. ⟪k:7⟫E eu queria contar a ele sobre o "
"homem terrível que esteve lá alguns dias antes.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Sobre como estive com medo.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Eu queria que ele me dissesse que ficaria tudo bem."

#: search2:search2_3D8949E0_D176_4AA8_86CB_560BE99FDA4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f9521f9894cc68c0723492a2f26398bafdfb154d7d9581e24d60cc079c7b379
#. default-sha256: 0952d213ccb14e4f4f395a88e4aa38318b4064f20005218b56ef9f9fc74777c3
msgctxt "search2:search2_3D8949E0_D176_4AA8_86CB_560BE99FDA4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I said, opening the door without a second thought.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The light of the sun "
"was so bright all I could make out was his silhouette. ⟪k:5⟫I couldn’t see the look on his face "
"or the look in his eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu disse, abrindo a porta sem pensar duas vezes.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A luz do sol era tão "
"brilhante que tudo o que pude ver foi sua silhueta. ⟪k:5⟫Não conseguia ver o o seu rosto ou o "
"olhar em seus olhos."

#: search2:search2_F05F1DDC_1CDA_40DA_93F2_CD953ADAE180
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: daf2fbe75b51a128dba1d1a3c47434cc0774e38f601688508d68f12fdbf801eb
#. default-sha256: 61f36b356abba7852541704b53474d352cb15bd574ca79d27e7c940724bd4b6d
msgctxt "search2:search2_F05F1DDC_1CDA_40DA_93F2_CD953ADAE180"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A gentle breeze blew past.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And my mind froze.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫How could "
"this be happening?⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫What did it mean?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Why?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫How?"
"⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫What was that man doing ⟪k:20⟫standing behind him?⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Why was he "
"carrying a sword?⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫Why was he coming into my house?⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫And "
"why did he swing it down,⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫severing my arm?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Uma brisa suave passou.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫E minha mente congelou.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Como isso "
"podia estar acontecendo?⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫O que isso significava?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Por que?⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Como?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫O que aquele homem estava fazendo ⟪k:20⟫parado atrás dele?"
"⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Por que ele estava carregando uma espada?⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫Por que ele estava "
"entrando na minha casa?⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫E por que ele a brandiu,⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫cortando "
"meu braço?"

#: search2:search2_61C2CC73_AEA9_4999_8D52_C92C7D3979CB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e971e111688387450dc7bab1c799beb22c8e8549cf5b8c76aee869aa7cf4ef10
#. default-sha256: 7e235a23dd9bc5445c53aab1142d510feab70556ae6ae53284cb84eb3fdae8cc
msgctxt "search2:search2_61C2CC73_AEA9_4999_8D52_C92C7D3979CB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It was a hideous, visceral noise. ⟪k:2⟫A sound I had never thought a saint could make. "
"⟪k:3⟫The same ear-splitting howl the slaves had made as the man had butchered them.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"I writhed. I wailed. I wept. I crawled across the floor through my own blood. ⟪k:7⟫I begged and I "
"begged and I begged for my life.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫The man walked over and picked up my severed arm, "
"⟪k:11⟫and then, shockingly, he tossed it to the kindhearted young man, ⟪k:12⟫after which he said,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Era um barulho horrível e visceral. ⟪k:2⟫Um som que nunca pensei que uma santa pudesse "
"fazer. ⟪k:3⟫O mesmo uivo ensurdecedor que os escravos fizeram quando o homem os massacrou.⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Eu me contorci. Eu lamentei. Chorei. Rastejei pelo chão através do meu próprio sangue. "
"⟪k:7⟫Implorei e implorei e implorei por minha vida.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫O homem se aproximou e pegou "
"meu braço decepado, ⟪k:11⟫e então, chocantemente, o jogou para o jovem de bom coração, ⟪k:12⟫após "
"o que ele disse,"

#: search2:search2_C8410C8E_5A6F_45A3_8E07_E4CD8FB4B1AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6eb55ea8bc0cf95a30368ab92b756c4c05a5a858a305a2f85518814594d478ba
#. default-sha256: f9b91874fb6a6ecfc39beaf9f0e57612b1ab9cb018aad0d6f04cf94a4e646faf
msgctxt "search2:search2_C8410C8E_5A6F_45A3_8E07_E4CD8FB4B1AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Share?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫What did he mean by “share”?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫What was he talking "
"about?⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Why had he given him my arm—and why had he taken it?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Why "
"was he talking like they knew each other?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Why? Why?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫I had "
"spared blood for him when he asked, hadn’t I? ⟪k:20⟫So why was he doing this?⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫"
"Was cutting my arm off and stealing it easier on his conscience than simply ⟪k:24⟫asking⟪k:25⟫?"
"⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫You understand how I felt, don’t you?⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫You can put "
"yourself in my shoes, can’t you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Parte?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫O que ele quis dizer com “parte”?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Do que estava "
"falando?⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Por que deu a ele meu braço—e por que ele o pegou?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Por "
"que estava falando como se eles se conhecessem?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Por que? Por que?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫"
"⟪k:19⟫Eu havia dado sangue para ele quando pediu, não foi? ⟪k:20⟫Então por que estava fazendo "
"isso?⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Cortar meu braço e roubá-lo era mais leve para sua consciência do que "
"simplesmente ⟪k:24⟫pedir⟪k:25⟫?⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫Você entende como eu me senti, não é?⟪k:30⟫"
"⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫Pode se colocar no meu lugar, não pode?"

#: search2:search2_773AFB1F_D3FC_4BDC_B7B7_1794926E3F69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30757d6778b20057cc2bfb0178ae770005233eca702ffbe8cdaa50f9195dd76b
#. default-sha256: dd55ad35444bf779939f4d78f8d62c9bc4a3468a988c021e8d16426138913c3c
msgctxt "search2:search2_773AFB1F_D3FC_4BDC_B7B7_1794926E3F69"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The young man refused to look me in the eye. ⟪k:2⟫Holding my bloody arm in his "
"trembling hands, he fled from the cottage as quickly as his legs would allow.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The "
"man then walked over and picked me up.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I had neither the strength nor willpower to "
"resist.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Holding me in his arms, he began to speak.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Telling me "
"things I didn’t want to know.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Things I didn’t want to hear.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫But "
"he didn’t care."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O jovem se recusou a me olhar nos olhos. ⟪k:2⟫Segurando meu braço ensanguentado em suas "
"mãos trêmulas, ele fugiu da cabana o mais rápido que suas pernas permitiram.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫O "
"homem então se aproximou e me pegou.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Eu não tinha energia nem força de vontade para "
"resistir.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Segurando-me em seus braços, começou a falar.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Me "
"dizendo coisas que eu não queria saber.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Coisas que não queria ouvir.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫Mas ele não se importava."

#: search2:search2_F75B0BC6_CD39_4664_AC75_3167EE58A243
