msgctxt "search2:search2_1B01C5B2_4399_4C85_B551_DD668454F45F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“to keep her church from collapsing.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫To keep her world from collapsing.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“para evitar que a igreja dela desmorone.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Para evitar que o mundo dela "
"desmorone.”"

#: search2:search2_513CF30B_D0B2_4BF0_81E9_01C712E15CA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3ca1a98a5784e011bd7ab1ac19e5cf175a6829df4ef20a917f47902d8580ac4
#. default-sha256: 78f40bb9ad00b2a3d971f62b3dc7e562dca2117ab2458ac41eaecca7ece7a708
msgctxt "search2:search2_513CF30B_D0B2_4BF0_81E9_01C712E15CA3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I⟪k:3⟫ was the saint.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Why was this woman, who didn’t have the "
"ability to perform miracles, being worshiped like she did? ⟪k:7⟫Why did the people of the city "
"idolize her? ⟪k:8⟫Why were their smiles all directed at her?⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Why...⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫was I...⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫not in her place?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu⟪k:3⟫ era a santa.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Por que essa mulher, que não tinha a capacidade "
"de fazer milagres, estava sendo adorada? ⟪k:7⟫Por que as pessoas da cidade a idolatravam? ⟪k:8⟫"
"Por que todos os sorrisos deles eram direcionados a ela?⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Por que...⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫eu não...⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫estava no lugar dela?"

#: search2:search2_BFC582D8_5DB5_43F3_99B8_F4CFAAD8CB4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77f5f8b41b996eeeb29b8030c5cdc6e1ec74d03aa12806af28a62aed04ad4b69
