msgctxt "search2:search2_BFC582D8_5DB5_43F3_99B8_F4CFAAD8CB4F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The man carried me to the top of the observation tower. ⟪k:2⟫It was there... ⟪k:3⟫that "
"I had my reunion with the lord."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O homem me carregou até o topo da torre de observação. ⟪k:2⟫Foi lá... ⟪k:3⟫que tive meu "
"reencontro com o lorde."

#: search2:search2_23FE4E35_1CE4_4AE8_9EC9_E05DF038257D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 595d6a2a118056d9eea36230bd1567cd33cda9becab8897a672add122dc3914a
#. default-sha256: 976c2c8184fb81d569eacee7e1f4f6422f9c5965efa6de3cbbd6b50e7d402540
msgctxt "search2:search2_23FE4E35_1CE4_4AE8_9EC9_E05DF038257D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I was to spill my blood for the people of the city. ⟪k:6⟫But also "
"for the lord’s profit.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫He was not offering free aid, but selling it as medicine. "
"⟪k:10⟫He claimed it was a miracle elixir, telling no one that it was actually my blood. ⟪k:11⟫It "
"was mixed with a beautiful red wine, and drinking it would cure you of any ailment.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫If they knew it was actually the blood of a witch, they would think it unclean. They would "
"fear it.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Ahaha...⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Ahahahahahaha...⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫"
"Ahahahahahahahahahahahahahaha..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Eu deveria derramar meu sangue pelo povo da cidade. ⟪k:6⟫Mas também "
"para o lucro do lorde.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Ele não estava oferecendo ajuda gratuita, mas vendendo como "
"remédio. ⟪k:10⟫Alegava que era um elixir milagroso, não contando a ninguém que na verdade era meu "
"sangue. ⟪k:11⟫Ele era misturado com um belo vinho tinto, e beber o curaria de qualquer doença."
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Se soubessem que na verdade era o sangue de uma bruxa, pensariam que era "
"impuro. Teriam medo dele.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Ahaha...⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Ahahahahahaha...⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫"
"⟪k:23⟫Ahahahahahahahahahahahahahaha..."

#: search2:search2_81345CCB_66E5_47B9_A631_F8CB42FE90BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 061003b751ca241f3394e81abfd961d166eaf7ccacb648d23161c0b3ff33fc27
#. default-sha256: e7c50aa9ddba5b36c6fdfc465cfa569dd15ff198ff5851ddabe6ffe32b9ba96a
msgctxt "search2:search2_81345CCB_66E5_47B9_A631_F8CB42FE90BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Time went on, and I grew progressively weaker.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I lost the will to eat—and "
"the will to live.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫My only view from the tower was the clouds through a window high "
"up on the wall. ⟪k:8⟫Occasionally, a pigeon would fly in, ⟪k:9⟫sometimes a butterfly, ⟪k:10⟫and I "
"would glare in envy as it fluttered around, free to come and go as it pleased."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O tempo passou, e eu fiquei progressivamente mais fraca.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Perdi a vontade "
"de comer—e a vontade de viver.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Minha única visão da torre eram as nuvens através de "
"uma janela no alto da parede. ⟪k:8⟫Ocasionalmente, um pombo voava para dentro, ⟪k:9⟫às vezes uma "
"borboleta, ⟪k:10⟫e eu olhava com inveja enquanto ela esvoaçava, livre para ir e vir quando "
"quisesse."

#: search2:search2_47012167_C7E1_419D_8AA7_917F168C5343
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99ff5dcd3b00834b8f99864e04facb814186e2a8cc59ba0860e13c033d934fcd
#. default-sha256: 9916d477a8b93b2ab23a9e22e119ad215614a3399a8e5dabfa57178f0fb1172f
msgctxt "search2:search2_47012167_C7E1_419D_8AA7_917F168C5343"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And soon, it was spring.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Every spring, the church held a festival to pray "
"for the coming year’s harvest and the people’s wellbeing. ⟪k:5⟫I could hear the bustle from far "
"below through the window as everyone rushed to prepare."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E logo, era primavera.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Toda primavera, a igreja realizava um festival "
"para orar pela colheita do ano seguinte e pelo bem-estar das pessoas. ⟪k:5⟫Eu podia ouvir a "
"agitação lá de baixo pela janela enquanto todos corriam para se preparar."

#: search2:search2_44DBED03_F517_4117_A0DB_093369E13042
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c135230c6c0a904bc9f3f4bb941bd9e89eea86ed0a4b6d1f68bd73d699a9dea3
#. default-sha256: 4629b744b27a856865646b44599c9d723f7766376688f2ee8d9f3c8a2e7ac5c7
msgctxt "search2:search2_44DBED03_F517_4117_A0DB_093369E13042"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I heard people praising the “Saintess”—though ⟪k:2⟫I⟪k:3⟫, the true saint, was locked "
"in the tower.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I heard people thanking the lord for his generous donations and "
"miracle medicine—though it had all come from me.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Propped up on my suffering, ⟪k:10⟫"
"they cheered and clinked glasses of my bloody wine."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ouvi pessoas elogiando a “Saintess”—embora ⟪k:2⟫eu⟪k:3⟫, a verdadeira santa, estivesse "
"trancada na torre.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ouvi pessoas agradecendo ao lorde por suas generosas doações e "
"remédios milagrosos—embora tudo tivesse vindo de mim.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Apoiados no meu sofrimento, "
"⟪k:10⟫eles aplaudiam e brindavam com os copos do meu vinho de sangue."

