msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“How... can you be so calm?!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Do you understand what you’ve done?”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Como... pode estar tão calmo?!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Entende o que você fez?”"

